#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:81
msgid ""
"The **SYN** pad on the header is connected directly to the camera sensor's "
"trigger / exposure line — it does **not** route to the MCU on the H7 Plus. "
"Drive or read it externally; you can't toggle it from MicroPython."
msgstr ""
"排针上的 **SYN** 焊盘直接连接到摄像头传感器的触发/曝光线——在 H7 Plus 上它\\ **不**\\ 连接到 "
"MCU。请在外部驱动或读取它；无法通过 MicroPython 进行切换。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:87
msgid "Power pins"
msgstr "电源引脚"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:89
msgid ""
"**3.3V** — regulated 3.3 V rail. Up to 250 mA available for shields (less if"
" the microSD card is in use). Unlike the newer cameras this pin is "
"bidirectional — see the warning below."
msgstr ""
"**3.3V** —— 稳压 3.3 V 电源轨。最多可为扩展板提供 250 mA（使用 microSD "
"卡时会更少）。与较新的摄像头不同，该引脚是双向的——请参阅下方的警告。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:92
msgid ""
"**VIN** — 3.6 – 5 V input. Powers the board through the on‑board regulator."
msgstr "**VIN** —— 3.6 – 5 V 输入。通过板载稳压器为开发板供电。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:94
msgid "**GND** — common ground."
msgstr "**GND** —— 公共地。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:96
msgid ""
"A 3.7 V LiPo connector is also present, but **the H7 Plus does not have a "
"battery charger** — connect a pre‑charged cell, or supply VIN / USB instead."
msgstr ""
"板上也有一个 3.7 V LiPo 接口，但 **H7 Plus 没有电池充电器**\\ ——请连接已充电的电池，或改用 VIN / USB 供电。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:102
msgid ""
"When both USB and VIN/LiPo are present, the **VIN/LiPo input wins** — the "
"on‑board power switch picks it over USB to power the board."
msgstr "当 USB 和 VIN/LiPo 同时存在时，\\ **VIN/LiPo 输入优先**\\ ——板载电源开关会选择它而非 USB 为开发板供电。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:107
msgid ""
"The **battery connector and VIN are tied together** on the H7 Plus. Do "
"**not** plug in a LiPo and apply VIN at the same time — the two supplies "
"will fight each other and can damage the battery, the board, or both."
msgstr ""
"在 H7 Plus 上，\\ **电池接口和 VIN 是连接在一起的**\\ 。请\\ **不要**\\ 同时插入 LiPo 电池并施加 "
"VIN——两路电源会互相冲突，可能损坏电池、开发板或两者。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:114
msgid ""
"You **may** power the H7 Plus by feeding 3.3 V directly into the ``3.3V`` "
"pin if you don't want to go through the on‑board regulator. In that case, "
"**do not also apply VIN or USB power at the same time** — back‑driving the "
"regulator while another supply is active can permanently damage and destroy "
"the camera."
msgstr ""
"如果你不想经过板载稳压器，\\ **可以**\\ 将 3.3 V 直接馈入 ``3.3V`` 引脚来为 H7 Plus 供电。在这种情况下，\\ "
"**请不要同时再施加 VIN 或 USB 电源**\\ ——在另一路电源处于激活状态时反向驱动稳压器可能会永久损坏并毁坏摄像头。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:122
msgid ""
"Use the :doc:`battery life estimator <../tutorial/tools/battery-life-"
"estimator>` to model how long the H7 Plus will run on a battery for a given "
"active / deep-sleep duty cycle."
msgstr ""
"使用 :doc:`电池续航估算器 <../tutorial/tools/battery-life-estimator>` 来建模 H7 Plus "
"在给定的激活/深度睡眠占空比下能用电池运行多久。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:127
msgid "Recovery and debug pins"
msgstr "恢复与调试引脚"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:129
msgid ""
"**RESET** — pull to GND to reset the board. Releasing it lets the MCU start "
"up normally."
msgstr "**RESET** —— 拉至 GND 以复位开发板。释放后 MCU 即可正常启动。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:131
msgid ""
"**BOOT0** — pull to 3.3 V while powering the board to enter the STM32 ROM "
"bootloader (DFU mode). OpenMV IDE uses this mode to reflash the on‑board "
"bootloader."
msgstr ""
"**BOOT0** —— 在为开发板供电时拉至 3.3 V，以进入 STM32 ROM 引导加载程序（DFU 模式）。OpenMV IDE "
"使用此模式来重新刷写板载引导加载程序。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:135
msgid ""
"The board exposes an **SWD** debug header (RST / SWCLK / SWDIO / SWO) next "
"to the GPIO header, compatible with ST‑LINK and SEGGER J‑Link adapters."
msgstr ""
"开发板在 GPIO 排针旁提供了 **SWD** 调试接口（RST / SWCLK / SWDIO / SWO），与 ST‑LINK 和 SEGGER "
"J‑Link 适配器兼容。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:141
msgid ""
"The **SWO** trace pin is shared with the camera header's SPI clock line. SWO"
" can't be used at the same time as any camera module that communicates with "
"the MCU over SPI — for example the **FLIR® Lepton® Adapter Module** — pick "
"one or the other."
msgstr ""
"**SWO** 跟踪引脚与摄像头排针的 SPI 时钟线共用。SWO 无法与任何通过 SPI 与 MCU 通信的摄像头模块同时使用——例如 **FLIR®"
" Lepton® 适配器模块**\\ ——只能二选一。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:147
msgid "Onboard peripherals"
msgstr "板载外设"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:150
msgid "LEDs"
msgstr "LED"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:152
msgid ""
"The H7 Plus has a single user RGB LED plus a pair of high‑power 850 nm IR "
"LEDs:"
msgstr "H7 Plus 配有单个用户 RGB LED 以及一对大功率 850 nm 红外 LED："

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:155
msgid ""
"**User RGB LED** — software‑controllable, exposed as ``LED_RED``, "
"``LED_GREEN`` and ``LED_BLUE``::"
msgstr ""
"**用户 RGB LED** —— 软件可控，公开为 ``LED_RED``\\ 、\\ ``LED_GREEN`` 和 ``LED_BLUE``\\ "
"：："

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:164
msgid ""
"**IR LEDs** — both LEDs are driven together through the ``LED_IR`` pin. "
"``LED_IR`` is wired **active high** in hardware while the firmware treats "
"every other on‑board LED as active low, so use :meth:`~machine.Pin.low` / "
":meth:`~machine.Pin.high` rather than :meth:`~machine.LED.on` / "
":meth:`~machine.LED.off` (which would invert the sense)::"
msgstr ""
"**红外 LED** —— 两颗 LED 通过 ``LED_IR`` 引脚一同驱动。\\ ``LED_IR`` 在硬件上接成\\ **高电平有效**\\"
" ，而固件将其他所有板载 LED 视为低电平有效，因此请使用 :meth:`~machine.Pin.low` / "
":meth:`~machine.Pin.high` 而非 :meth:`~machine.LED.on` / "
":meth:`~machine.LED.off`\\ （后者会反转逻辑）：："

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:178
msgid "Camera sensor"
msgstr "摄像头传感器"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:180
msgid "The OV5640 is driven through the :doc:`/library/omv.csi` module::"
msgstr "OV5640 通过 :doc:`/library/omv.csi` 模块驱动：："

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:193
msgid ""
"The OV5640 has an on-board JPEG compressor. Set `csi.CSI.pixformat` to "
"`csi.JPEG` and the sensor delivers compressed frames straight to the cam "
"over the camera bus, which makes high-resolution captures practical: "
"`csi.HD` (1280×720), `csi.FHD` (1920×1080), and the full 5MP `csi.WQXGA2` "
"(2592×1944) all stream as JPEG. Tune the compression with `csi.CSI.quality` "
"(0-100, higher = larger frames, more detail)::"
msgstr ""
"OV5640 带有板载 JPEG 压缩器。将 `csi.CSI.pixformat` 设置为 `csi.JPEG`\\ "
"，传感器便会通过摄像头总线将压缩帧直接传送到摄像头，使高分辨率采集变得切实可行：\\ `csi.HD`\\ （1280×720）、\\ "
"`csi.FHD`\\ （1920×1080）以及完整的 5MP `csi.WQXGA2`\\ （2592×1944）都能以 JPEG "
"形式流式传输。可用 `csi.CSI.quality`\\ （0-100，越高 = 帧越大、细节越多）调整压缩：："

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:206
msgid ""
"The sensor sits on a **removable module** — swap it for any of the other "
"OpenMV camera modules (global shutter, thermal, higher resolution, etc.) "
"without changing the rest of the board."
msgstr ""
"传感器位于一个\\ **可拆卸模块**\\ 上——可将其更换为任何其他 OpenMV "
"摄像头模块（全局快门、热成像、更高分辨率等），而无需更改开发板的其余部分。"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:211
msgid "Machine learning"
msgstr "机器学习"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/openmv-cam-h7-plus.rst:213
msgid ""
":doc:`/library/omv.ml` runs quantised TFLite models on the Cortex‑M7 with "
"**CMSIS‑NN** kernels — fast enough for compact detectors at a few frames per"
" second. Models on the read‑only ``/rom`` filesystem load directly from "
"flash without copying to RAM. Here's a 128×128 BlazeFace detector overlaying"
" the detected face and its six landmarks on every frame::"
msgstr ""
":doc:`/library/omv.ml` 使用 **CMSIS‑NN** 内核在 Cortex‑M7 上运行量化的 TFLite "
"模型——速度足以让紧凑型检测器以每秒几帧的速度运行。位于只读 ``/rom`` 文件系统上的模型可直接从闪存加载，无需复制到 RAM。下面是一个 "
"128×128 的 BlazeFace 检测器，将检测到的人脸及其六个关键点叠加到每一帧上：："

